name: Lucky Lola
author: waterbear — for Lola (Lucky Cat is her favorite)
description: >
  Lola's seed. Lucky Cat gains X0.25 Mult — permanently — every time a Lucky card
  triggers. Pair it with Oops! All 6s, which DOUBLES every probability so the Lucky
  cards hit twice as often (and it stacks — 3 or 4 Oops = 8-16x the luck, the cat
  snowballs forever). Showman lets the Oops dupes exist; Seltzer retriggers every
  card for even more lucky hits. pi loves you — and so does Lola.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - uncommonJoker: LuckyCat
    antes:
      - 1
      - 2
      - 3
  - uncommonJoker: OopsAll6s
    antes:
      - 1
      - 2
      - 3
should:
  - uncommonJoker: OopsAll6s
    antes:
      - 1
      - 2
      - 3
      - 4
      - 5
    score: 60
  - uncommonJoker: Showman
    score: 30
    max: 1
  - uncommonJoker: Seltzer
    score: 25
  - commonJoker: Splash
    score: 15
  - luckyMult: [0, 1, 2, 3]
    with:
      luck: 4
    score: 50
  - luckyMoney: [0, 1]
    with:
      luck: 4
    score: 20
